 removes:**\n- `<script>` tags and all their contents\n- Event handler attributes (`onclick`, `onload`, `onerror`, `onmouseover`, etc.)\n- `javascript:` protocol URLs in `href` and `src` attributes\n- `data:` URLs in `src` attributes (another XSS vector)\n\n**What it preserves:**\n- All HTML structure (tags, attributes, content)\n- Original formatting, whitespace, and line breaks\n- All legitimate attributes and CSS classes\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\npython filter.py input.html\n```\n\nThe script modifies the file in-place. It uses regex-based replacement rather than HTML parsing to ensure formatting is never altered—only harmful JavaScript is removed.","ttft_ms":37327,"type":"result","duration_ms":40367,"uuid":"e97243bb-242c-4171-82ce-fc3e553c5968","ttft_stream_ms":725,"time_to_request_ms":83,"queued_turn_count":0}
